msgid ""
"[center][b]Poké Tactics[/b] es un proyecto de fans, gratuito y sin ánimo de lucro.\n"
"No está afiliado a Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. ni The Pokémon Company.[/center]\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Pokémon[/b][/color]\n"
"Pokémon y sus personajes son marcas y propiedad de Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. y The Pokémon Company. Gracias a sus creadores por más de 25 años de aventuras.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Modelos 3D[/b][/color]\n"
"Repositorio [url=https://github.com/pokemon-party/3d-pokemon]3d-pokemon[/url] de [url=https://github.com/Pokemon-3D-api]Pokémon 3D API[/url] (Sudhanshu Ambastha), que reúne modelos publicados en Sketchfab. Los modelos son propiedad de Nintendo / Creatures Inc. / GAME FREAK inc. Las animaciones se hicieron para este juego con Blender.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Datos[/b][/color]\n"
"[url=https://pokemonshowdown.com]Pokémon Showdown[/url] (MIT): estadísticas, tipos, ataques y learnsets.\n"
"[url=https://pokeapi.co]PokeAPI[/url] (BSD): nombres y descripciones en español, y los sprites de los objetos.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Sonido[/b][/color]\n"
"Efectos de [url=https://kenney.nl]Kenney[/url] (CC0). La música, los ambientes y los gritos se generan por código.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Herramientas[/b][/color]\n"
"Hecho con [url=https://godotengine.org]Godot Engine[/url] (MIT), [url=https://www.blender.org]Blender[/url] y [url=https://gltf-transform.dev]glTF Transform[/url]."
msgstr ""
"[center][b]Poké Tactics[/b] is a free, non-profit fan project.\n"
"It is not affiliated with Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. or The Pokémon Company.[/center]\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Pokémon[/b][/color]\n"
"Pokémon and its characters are trademarks and property of Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK inc. and The Pokémon Company. Thanks to their creators for more than 25 years of adventures.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]3D models[/b][/color]\n"
"The [url=https://github.com/pokemon-party/3d-pokemon]3d-pokemon[/url] repository by [url=https://github.com/Pokemon-3D-api]Pokémon 3D API[/url] (Sudhanshu Ambastha), which gathers models published on Sketchfab. The models are property of Nintendo / Creatures Inc. / GAME FREAK inc. The animations were made for this game with Blender.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Data[/b][/color]\n"
"[url=https://pokemonshowdown.com]Pokémon Showdown[/url] (MIT): stats, types, moves and learnsets.\n"
"[url=https://pokeapi.co]PokeAPI[/url] (BSD): names and descriptions, and the item sprites.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Sound[/b][/color]\n"
"Sound effects by [url=https://kenney.nl]Kenney[/url] (CC0). The music, ambiences and cries are generated in code.\n"
"\n"
"[color=#ffcc40][b]Tools[/b][/color]\n"
"Made with [url=https://godotengine.org]Godot Engine[/url] (MIT), [url=https://www.blender.org]Blender[/url] and [url=https://gltf-transform.dev]glTF Transform[/url]."

